#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:5
#: 7569f722db324f5285ecda7b615c2c94
msgid "CubePilot Here+ RTK GPS"
msgstr "CubePilot Here+ RTK GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:7
#: 2e509ee6ca7c4e05bcbe00152f8d84b8
msgid ""
"This article provides a brief overview of how to setup a Here+ RTK GPS "
"receiver which is based on the Ublox M8P. Like other RTK GPSs, the Here+ can"
" provide much more accurate position estimates than regular GPSs but "
"normally requires the use of a 2nd GPS connected to the ground station. "
"These instructions focus on the setup using Mission Planner on Windows, but "
"HERE+ is also supported by QGroundControl."
msgstr ""
"本文简要介绍如何设置基于 Ublox M8P 的 Here+ RTK GPS 接收机。与其他 RTK GPS 一样，Here+ 可提供比普通 GPS "
"精度高得多的位置估算，但通常需要使用第二个连接到地面站的 GPS。本说明以在 Windows 上使用 Mission Planner "
"为主，QGroundControl 也支持 HERE+。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:15
#: 5dff343d8ce445639054ad5b4652e7c9
msgid "Where to buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:17
#: 10767fd18eb84b54b65b61a32fcbb6a9
msgid ""
"Newer generation of this product can be purchased through CubePilot "
"`resellers <https://cubepilot.org/#/reseller/list>`__"
msgstr ""
"该产品的新一代版本可通过 CubePilot `经销商 <https://cubepilot.org/#/reseller/list>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:20
#: 38e4f614857c4954b29afa7302cc2277
msgid "Connecting the vehicle and base station GPSs"
msgstr "连接飞行器和基站 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:22
#: 048986b38bed497cb559075536a389b9
msgid ""
"The Here+ GPS kit comes with a larger round GPS (also knows as the "
"\"Rover\") that should be mounted on the vehicle so that the round button is"
" on the top and the faint arrow is pointing forwards."
msgstr "Here+ GPS 套件包含一个较大的圆形 GPS（也称为「Rover」），应安装在飞行器上，使圆形按钮朝上，浅色箭头朝前。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:24
#: f1d78a03e9244c84a5f1012fe8ce94cf
msgid ""
"This GPS is connected to the autopilot using the supplied 8-pin clickmate "
"connector (if using a Cube) or an optional 4pin+6pin DF13 connector (if "
"using Pixhawk)."
msgstr ""
"此 GPS 通过随附的 8 针 clickmate 连接器（如使用 Cube）或可选的 4 针+6 针 DF13 连接器（如使用 "
"Pixhawk）与飞控连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:26
#: 775391d886a149dfa66c1a7366420d15
msgid ""
"A smaller GPS (also known as the \"base station\") labelled \"here+\" is "
"also included along with its external antenna.  This GPS is connected to the"
" ground station PC using the supplied USB cable."
msgstr "套件还包含一个标注为「here+」的较小 GPS（也称为「基站」）及其外部天线。此 GPS 通过随附的 USB 线与地面站 PC 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:28
#: 37efdbf012494b12a56b4e550185d250
msgid "Below is a diagram showing how to connect the Here+ to a Pixhawk."
msgstr "以下是如何将 Here+ 连接到 Pixhawk 的示意图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:34
#: 60966c60e89b4547afaccf388781fff3
msgid "Installing the Drivers and U-Center"
msgstr "安装驱动程序和 U-Center"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:36
#: 6c39e5d0995c40cd8c9ce6c2c2f0eb36
msgid ""
"Windows  users  will need to download and install the `u-blox u-center "
"application and drivers <https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/u-center>`__ in "
"order to update the firmware to The new version of 1.30 firmware which "
"includes new feature of fusing other satellite systems (Glonass / beidou) "
"with GPS for RTK operations, effectively increasing the RTK positioning "
"accuracy. Therefore, it is recommended that all users upgrade to 1.30 or "
"later firmware before using HERE+."
msgstr ""
"Windows 用户需要下载并安装 `u-blox u-center 应用程序和驱动程序 "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/u-center>`__，以便将固件升级到 1.30 "
"新版本。该版本包含融合其他卫星系统（GLONASS/北斗）与 GPS 进行 RTK 作业的新功能，有效提高 RTK 定位精度。因此，建议所有用户在使用 "
"HERE+ 前升级到 1.30 或更高版本固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:38
#: 2ee6d37ee3a3457bbe893d6bebe84a34
msgid ""
"If installed correctly, when plugged in, the GPS should appear in the Device"
" Manager as \"USB Serial Device\"."
msgstr "如果安装正确，插入时 GPS 应在设备管理器中显示为「USB Serial Device」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:44
#: e3ecc6e443cc489dae1466b9c03298e8
msgid "Upgrading U-blox Firmware"
msgstr "升级 U-blox 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:45
#: bafe7b9a9f5a44eb9e9340ceab7cef3e
msgid ""
"The default firmware version of the HERE + modules is ublox-1.10 firmware. "
"The newer version of 1.30  or later firmware includes new feature of fusing "
"other satellite systems (Glonass / beidou) with GPS for RTK operations, "
"effectively increasing the RTK positioning accuracy. Therefore, it is "
"recommended that all users upgrade to 1.30 or later firmware before using "
"HERE+."
msgstr ""
"HERE+ 模块的默认固件版本为 ublox-1.10 固件。1.30 或更高版本固件包含将其他卫星系统（GLONASS/北斗）与 GPS 融合进行 "
"RTK 作业的新功能，有效提高 RTK 定位精度。因此，建议所有用户在使用 HERE+ 前升级到 1.30 或更高版本固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:47
#: 023df68e3c7d45f6893bb4903bd63edf
msgid ""
"Later versions have also been released. 1.40 version firmware introduced a "
"new feature called the mobile base station, that is, the base station need "
"not be fixed in a location. For example, a base station may be placed on a "
"moving vehicle or boat. Upgrading to Ublox-1.40 version is similar to "
"upgrading to 1.30. For users who do not need to use the mobile baseline "
"feature, upgrading to version 1.30 is sufficient."
msgstr ""
"后续还发布了更高版本。1.40 版本固件引入了移动基站功能，即基站无需固定在某个位置。例如，基站可放置在移动车辆或船只上。升级到 Ublox-1.40 "
"版本的方法与升级到 1.30 类似。对于不需要移动基站功能的用户，升级到 1.30 版本即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:49
#: 50ad8c3b77104e45aa5a9601ebe50685
msgid ""
"Firmware releases can be found `here "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/neo-m8p-series?legacy=Current#Documentation-&-resources>`__."
" Download the base (reference) and/or rover version , as appropriate to use "
"in the following step."
msgstr ""
"固件发布版本可`在此处 "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/neo-m8p-series?legacy=Current#Documentation-&-resources>`__"
" 找到。请根据需要下载基站（参考站）和/或流动站版本，以用于以下步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:52
#: 6858bc61d79843a68a9e2ccafb1f4f3a
msgid "Upgrading Firmware"
msgstr "升级固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:53
#: 2d08bf897df64e938f64ae6af6b79444
msgid ""
"Upgrading firmware requires the use of Ublox's Windows software U-center. To"
" download U-center, please go to the `official website "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/u-center-windows>`__. Then follow the "
"prompts to install U-cent software. During the installation process, you "
"will be prompted to install the device Driver, please ensure that only the "
"Standard Driver For Windows is checked, as shown below."
msgstr ""
"升级固件需要使用 Ublox 的 Windows 软件 U-center。要下载 U-center，请访问`官方网站 "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/product/u-center-windows>`__。然后按照提示安装 U-center "
"软件。安装过程中会提示安装设备驱动程序，请确保仅勾选「Standard Driver For Windows」，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:60
#: 6760a9dc89c64991b5c723dfe6940da6
msgid "Connect your HERE+ Base and Rover to Computer"
msgstr "将 HERE+ 基站和流动站连接到计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:61
#: 7e7ffc120b30424784a8af0666c2d521
msgid ""
"When upgrading the base station module, use the USB cable to connect the "
"base station module to the computer USB interface, as shown in the following"
" figure:"
msgstr "升级基站模块时，使用 USB 线将基站模块连接到计算机 USB 接口，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:66
#: f59fda515af44d9eb28cec7d0587f61a
msgid ""
"When upgrading a Rover module, use a hexagonal screwdriver to open the case."
" The rover module has a USB interface connector identical to the base "
"module, you can use the base module USB cable to connect rover to computer. "
"In addition, during the firmware upgrading process, the rover module needs "
"to be powered by connecting to autopilot, as shown in the following figure:"
msgstr ""
"升级流动站模块时，使用六角螺丝刀打开外壳。流动站模块具有与基站模块相同的 USB 接口连接器，可使用基站模块的 USB "
"线将流动站连接到计算机。此外，固件升级过程中，流动站模块需要通过连接到飞控来供电，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:73
#: e715b145d50c48e4b647ee4dc6a327eb
msgid "Upgrading Process"
msgstr "升级流程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:74
#: 278947d2dcc049558f2169c74b70aea7
msgid ""
"Open the U-center software, click the connection button (as shown in the red"
" circle), select the com port that corresponds to your base/ rover module."
msgstr "打开 U-center 软件，点击连接按钮（如红圈所示），选择与基站/流动站模块对应的 COM 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:79
#: 82d61a5c795940f8b0992d515723698e
msgid ""
"Click tools->u-blox 5 – 8 Flash Firmware Update, and click the settings as "
"shown below:"
msgstr "点击 tools->u-blox 5 – 8 Flash Firmware Update，并按下图所示进行设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:88
#: adb4c14822f64a8ebc8851fb5aa6d2ad
msgid ""
"In Flash Information Structure(FIS) File, select Flash.xml，which is located "
"in the installation address of U-centre software."
msgstr ""
"在 Flash Information Structure(FIS) File 中，选择 Flash.xml，该文件位于 U-centre "
"软件的安装目录中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:93
#: 3d606ca195b54c17b2a32c21faa62cff
msgid ""
"Click OK and wait for the firmware uploading to complete. Uploading usually "
"takes only a minute or less. If the uploading is successful, the upgrade "
"interface is displayed in green; if the upgrade is aborted, the interface is"
" displayed in red. If the process is interrupted, or if it is not responding"
" for a long time, the modules will need to be power cycled and uploading "
"needs to be done again."
msgstr ""
"点击 OK "
"并等待固件上传完成。上传通常只需一分钟或更短时间。如果上传成功，升级界面显示为绿色；如果升级中止，界面显示为红色。如果过程中断或长时间无响应，模块需要重新上电，并重新进行上传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:96
#: 12a933b6b440488d97ab79a1edafa570
msgid "Check current Rover/Base firmware version"
msgstr "检查当前流动站/基站固件版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:97
#: 0c9737cacbbb48a7aed490f3f6cfdf46
msgid ""
"When base/rover is already connected to U-center, click View, go to Message "
"View -> UBX -> MON _> VER, you will see the interface below:"
msgstr ""
"当基站/流动站已连接到 U-center 时，点击 View，进入 Message View -> UBX -> MON _> VER，将看到以下界面："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:102
#: a65fc0896ba84695a10d44008edbf5a5
msgid ""
"As shown in the figure, the current firmware version is FWVER = HPG 1.30 "
"REF, indicating that the current firmware version is 1.30 for base module."
msgstr "如图所示，当前固件版本为 FWVER = HPG 1.30 REF，表示基站模块当前固件版本为 1.30。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:105
#: 5447fb5707aa4d6dbe398408352818ef
msgid "Basic operating manual"
msgstr "基本操作手册"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:106
#: e0f20d8daf7a4190a58796683cb36405
msgid ""
"This part of the tutorial uses Mission Planner ground control software and "
"ArduCopter-3.5 flight control firmware for operating instructions."
msgstr "本教程使用 Mission Planner 地面控制软件和 ArduCopter-3.5 飞控固件进行操作说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:109
#: cb57f70b0c2344b7828a815c1cf3f422
msgid "Preparation before operation."
msgstr "操作前准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:110
#: fdd5ec4064144b1fa588a14c2580a397
msgid "To use HERE+ on a UAV, you need the following hardware:"
msgstr "要在无人机上使用 HERE+，您需要以下硬件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:115
#: 2bc4c08d9c60400ea311f6b4e2f4e07e
msgid ""
"Before using, make sure the hardware is connected correctly: The base "
"station module is connected to the computer port through USB; a telemetry "
"module is connected to another USB port of the same computer. For UAV, HERE "
"+ rover module is connected to the autopilot GPS connector, telemetry module"
" is connected to the TELEM interface."
msgstr ""
"使用前，请确保硬件正确连接：基站模块通过 USB 连接到计算机端口；数传模块连接到同一台计算机的另一个 USB 端口。对于无人机，HERE+ "
"流动站模块连接到飞控的 GPS 连接器，数传模块连接到 TELEM 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:120
#: ed264d72aa064eb2a107d544719fcd07
msgid ""
"Place vehicle and base stations so that their GPS antennas have a clear view"
" of the sky (i.e. this will not work indoors!)."
msgstr "放置飞行器和基站，使其 GPS 天线能够清晰看到天空（即在室内无法使用！）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:121
#: c1eead19c2e648418a5035bddc30f100
msgid ""
"During operation, please place the base station in an outdoor environment "
"with sufficient sky coverage to obtain a good satellite signal. Place the "
"base station on a stable and elevated platform, such as a tripod."
msgstr "操作时，请将基站放置在天空开阔的室外环境中，以获得良好的卫星信号。将基站放置在稳定且较高的平台上，例如三脚架。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:126
#: 6657c09c09d1432f813d6a2410de6409
msgid ""
"Connect to the vehicle's autopilot (i.e. Pixhawk, Cube, etc) using Mission "
"Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 连接到飞行器飞控（即 Pixhawk、Cube 等）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:127
#: 8287283c5eba452e9c6639dcb43cd9ea
msgid "Open the Initial Setup >> Optional Hardware >> RTK GPS Inject screen"
msgstr "打开 Initial Setup >> Optional Hardware >> RTK GPS Inject 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:128
#: e6e35c02c2a84c2185ad166b06abd67c
msgid ""
"For first time setup in a new location, click the Enter Base Position "
"button, make sure the dialog box shows empty location information, as shown "
"below:"
msgstr "首次在新位置设置时，点击「Enter Base Position」按钮，确保对话框显示空的位置信息，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:134
#: 66512ab113094269acbea41b7811f2ba
msgid "Base module setting using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 设置基站模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:135
#: e4f5dde4769448dbaf08e74b5c811a6f
msgid ""
"Start with base module setup first. During the base station setup, the rover"
" and the UAV do not need to be turned on. Open the Mission Planner ground "
"station software on your computer and go to the initial setup -> Optional "
"Hardware -> RTK / GPS Inject page. You will see the following page:"
msgstr ""
"首先设置基站模块。在基站设置期间，流动站和无人机无需开机。在计算机上打开 Mission Planner 地面站软件，进入 Initial Setup "
"-> Optional Hardware -> RTK / GPS Inject 页面。将看到以下页面："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:140
#: 16ac811475c444da947e1b6d4a8c595a
msgid ""
"Select the correct base module com port in the top left corner and click "
"connect. In the SurveyIn Acc section, enter the absolute geographic accuracy"
" that you expect your HERE + base station to achieve. In the Time column, "
"enter the minimum survey time you expect. Click on Restart, the ground "
"station will transfer the data you have entered to the HERE + base module, "
"the base module will start a new round of surveying. You will see the "
"following page:"
msgstr ""
"在左上角选择正确的基站模块 COM 端口并点击连接。在 SurveyIn Acc 部分，输入您希望 HERE+ 基站达到的绝对地理精度。在 Time "
"列中，输入您期望的最短勘测时间。点击 Restart，地面站将把您输入的数据传输到 HERE+ 基站模块，基站模块将开始新一轮勘测。将看到以下页面："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:145
#: 9d3e2788663d44c9be8a9ce7fd96d100
msgid ""
"During the survey process, the right box will show the current survey "
"status: Position is invalid: base station has not yet reached a valid "
"location; In Progress: survey is still in progress; Duration: The number of "
"seconds that the current surveying task has been executed; Observation: the "
"number of observations acquired; Current Acc: Absolute geographic accuracy "
"that the current base station can achieve. The green bar at the lower part "
"of the Mission Planner page shows the satellites being detected and the "
"signal strength related to each satellite."
msgstr ""
"在勘测过程中，右侧框将显示当前勘测状态：Position is invalid：基站尚未达到有效位置；In "
"Progress：勘测仍在进行中；Duration：当前勘测任务已执行的秒数；Observation：已获取的观测数量；Current "
"Acc：当前基站可达到的绝对地理精度。Mission Planner 页面底部的绿色条显示正在检测的卫星及每颗卫星的信号强度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:147
#: 31f8550e082a4048b4b63436961bf0f2
msgid ""
"The base station needs a certain amount of time to meet the accuracy "
"requirements of your input. Testing shows that, in an open area without "
"shelter, to achieve the absolute accuracy of 2m takes a few minutes; to "
"reach the absolute accuracy of less than 30cm takes around an hour; to reach"
" the accuracy of 10cm takes a few hours."
msgstr ""
"基站需要一定时间来满足您输入的精度要求。测试表明，在无遮挡的开阔区域，达到 2m 绝对精度需要几分钟；达到 30cm 以内的绝对精度约需一小时；达到 "
"10cm 精度则需要几小时。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:151
#: 7e1f31bde74b478fa082ca7c58bd4587
msgid ""
"These duration could vary greatly by various factors. For example, to "
"achieve the absolute accuracy of 2m could take an hour."
msgstr "这些时长可能因各种因素而有很大差异。例如，达到 2m 绝对精度可能需要一小时。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:153
#: 4db23cbd56324db9a6b1fe39a660f6fc
msgid ""
"It should be noted that the absolute geographic accuracy of the base station"
" here will affect the absolute geographic accuracy of the rover module "
"without affecting the relative accuracy between the base station and rover. "
"If your application does not require UAV with high absolute geographic "
"accuracy, you do not need to set the base station's precision too high, "
"resulting in long survey time. Even if the accuracy of the base station is "
"1.5 to 2 m, the position accuracy of the rover module relative to the base "
"station can still reach centimeter level."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，基站的绝对地理精度将影响流动站模块的绝对地理精度，但不影响基站和流动站之间的相对精度。如果您的应用不需要无人机具有高绝对地理精度，则无需将基站精度设置得过高，否则会导致勘测时间过长。即使基站精度为"
" 1.5 至 2m，流动站模块相对于基站的位置精度仍可达到厘米级。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:155
#: cb7bfafc8c7d4dd29f4ed772b9d610a3
msgid ""
"After the survey is complete, Mission Planner will display the following "
"page:"
msgstr "勘测完成后，Mission Planner 将显示以下页面："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:160
#: d6bca0e4383e4d5e93722c724714b1fb
msgid ""
"In the RTCM box is shows that the base status indicator is green and both "
"the GPS and Glonass satellite systems are green (if you want to change the "
"satellite system, refer to the following section). The box on the right says"
" Position is valid."
msgstr ""
"在 RTCM 框中显示基站状态指示灯为绿色，GPS 和 GLONASS 卫星系统均为绿色（如需更改卫星系统，请参阅以下章节）。右侧框显示 "
"Position is valid。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:162
#: 90fbb8940ed14cfdb964ffa4291b2147
msgid ""
"To store the current location in the Mission Planner: Click Save Current "
"Pos, enter a name in the dialog box, and click OK. As shown below, you can "
"see your saved location in the list. Click the Use button for the location "
"you saved. The base station will enter the fixed mode and the status will "
"show Using FixedLLA. In the future, if you set the base station in the same "
"location, you do not need to conduct survey again, just click the Use button"
" that corresponds to the location you have saved."
msgstr ""
"要在 Mission Planner 中保存当前位置：点击 Save Current Pos，在对话框中输入名称，点击 "
"OK。如下图所示，可以在列表中看到已保存的位置。点击已保存位置的 Use 按钮。基站将进入固定模式，状态将显示 Using "
"FixedLLA。以后如果在相同位置设置基站，无需再次进行勘测，只需点击与已保存位置对应的 Use 按钮即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:168
#: 7c4244e9eca740a2aa2de7efcfdea5bd
msgid "Rover Module and Autopilot Setup"
msgstr "流动站模块与飞控设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:169
#: 00b6977a9be5475d91afae5a93e10ca1
msgid ""
"After the base station is set up, you can turn on the UAV. Using the same "
"Mission Planner to connect the telemetry module, the base station data will "
"be transmitted through telemetry module to the HERE + rover module on the "
"UAV. In the Mission Planner main page, you can see the current GPS status "
"displayed as RTK Float / RTK Fixed / 3D RTK, indicating that the positioning"
" of the UAV has entered the RTK mode. RTK Float is a floating-point "
"solution; RTK Fixed is a fixed solution. RTK Fixed mode has a higher "
"accuracy and requires better signal strength. 3D RTK is unified saying of "
"RTK Float / RTK in the Mission Planner Chinese version."
msgstr ""
"设置好基站后，可以开启无人机。使用同一个 Mission Planner 连接数传模块，基站数据将通过数传模块传输到无人机上的 HERE+ "
"流动站模块。在 Mission Planner 主页面，可以看到当前 GPS 状态显示为 RTK Float / RTK Fixed / 3D "
"RTK，表示无人机的定位已进入 RTK 模式。RTK Float 是浮点解；RTK Fixed 是固定解。RTK Fixed "
"模式精度更高，需要更好的信号强度。3D RTK 是 Mission Planner 中文版中对 RTK Float / RTK 的统一称谓。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:174
#: 37169375efcc428bb2221ed0ea9bb800
msgid ""
"In the SurveyIn Acc input box, key in the absolute accuracy of base station "
"you wish to achieve, in the unit of meters (for example, 0.50 means 50cm "
"accuracy). In the Time(s) input box, key in a reference time in seconds. "
"Depending on your desired accuracy, the base station may take more than your"
" input time to achieve the desired accuracy."
msgstr ""
"在 SurveyIn Acc 输入框中，输入希望基站达到的绝对精度（单位为米，例如 0.50 表示 50cm 精度）。在 Time(s) "
"输入框中，输入参考时间（秒）。根据您所需的精度，基站可能需要超过您输入的时间才能达到所需精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:179
#: 9640b43f05ad40429d83b78ea9c5f07a
msgid ""
"Select the COM port for the base station and press Connect (the baud rate "
"drop-down normally does not need to be set because it is automatically "
"detected)"
msgstr "选择基站的 COM 端口并点击 Connect（波特率下拉菜单通常无需设置，因为会自动检测）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:180
#: 0d0ffcb5b2d04eaeb29262ab4be43541
msgid "\"M8P autoconfig\" should be checked"
msgstr "应勾选 「M8P autoconfig」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:185
#: f319a45bb9474a95a2a795ea547e5c2c
msgid ""
"The satellite information will be visualized as green bars as shown in the "
"screen shot below."
msgstr "卫星信息将以绿色柱状图显示，如下图截图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:190
#: 3ec2a95f80d74361b305b0f006bc4a1a
msgid ""
"A line of text will indicate the current status of the surveying: SurveyIn "
"indicates whether the survey has achieved the desired accuracy of base "
"station, it will show ‘true’ when the survey has been completed."
msgstr "一行文字将显示当前勘测状态：SurveyIn 表示勘测是否达到了基站所需精度，勘测完成时将显示 「true」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:193
#: c93120d2b6a647f39fe5092580398faf
msgid ""
"InProgress shows whether the survey is still ongoing. A completed survey of "
"the current base position is indicated by the status messages SurveyIn "
"Valid: True, and InProgress: false."
msgstr ""
"InProgress 显示勘测是否仍在进行中。当前基站位置的完整勘测以状态消息 SurveyIn Valid: True 和 InProgress: "
"false 表示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:195
#: b7894ebd2f814619a52ee123c0600787
msgid "Duration: the duration of the survey in seconds"
msgstr "Duration：勘测持续时间（秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:197
#: d8a9dea4c4074240a17c01d274f9ec82
msgid "Obs: number of observations used for the survey"
msgstr "Obs：用于勘测的观测次数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:199
#: 76349bc2137040a6949842f7565d1a6a
msgid "Acc: current accuracy in meters"
msgstr "Acc：当前精度（米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:201
#: b158b363eb6b440dbb160e0963628145
msgid ""
"When the survey is completed as indicated by the SurveyIn: True message, you"
" may click the ‘Save current pos’ button and enter a name for the saved "
"position."
msgstr "当勘测完成并显示 SurveyIn: True 消息时，可点击 「Save current pos」 按钮并为保存的位置输入名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:202
#: 8689f91549524a50bdc10979e4e3368e
msgid ""
"The RTK messages from base station is sent to vehicle by MAVLink message. In"
" the main HUD of Mission Planer, the GPS status should display RTK Fix or "
"RTK Float"
msgstr ""
"基站的 RTK 消息通过 MAVLink 消息发送到飞行器。在 Mission Planner 主 HUD 中，GPS 状态应显示 RTK Fix 或 "
"RTK Float"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:207
#: 6778f70e5d564afd915478893a920637
msgid ""
"The information of the saved position will be displayed in the table as "
"shown in the screen shot below."
msgstr "保存的位置信息将显示在表格中，如下图截图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:212
#: d9c62e22cf4d4ef781d3e825f5d1aed3
msgid ""
"The saved position can be used the next time you set up the base station in "
"the exact same location. However, if you change to another location for "
"surveying, please ensure you clear the position information in the dialogue "
"box that pops up when you click ‘Enter Base Position’. Otherwise, the "
"previously saved point will be taken every time you connect to the base "
"module."
msgstr ""
"下次在完全相同的位置设置基站时，可以使用保存的位置。但是，如果切换到其他位置进行勘测，请确保清除点击 「Enter Base Position」 "
"时弹出对话框中的位置信息。否则，每次连接到基站模块时都会使用之前保存的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:215
#: e99e276e60c1452a9dc2b06c559bb0ab
msgid "Use U-centre for live data recording/replaying"
msgstr "使用 U-centre 进行实时数据录制/回放"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:216
#: 1580c64d7d044808925dbb404874c8a5
msgid ""
"One function of the U-center is to record the base / rover module data for "
"later analysis. Firstly, when the base or rover module is already connected "
"to U-center (in the same way it is connected when updating firmware), click "
"the following bug icon to turn on the debug message:"
msgstr ""
"U-center 的一个功能是记录基站/流动站模块数据以供后续分析。首先，当基站或流动站模块已连接到 "
"U-center（连接方式与更新固件时相同）时，点击以下虫形图标开启调试消息："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:221
#: ec08be13a45f4b15a2f7f88900e54ab8
msgid ""
"Then, click into View -> message view -> UBX -> RXM -> RTCM (RTCM input "
"status), right click to enable message."
msgstr ""
"然后，点击进入 View -> message view -> UBX -> RXM -> RTCM（RTCM 输入状态），右键点击以启用消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:226
#: eef97990cf5d40129222497506c2e933
msgid ""
"Finally, click on the red recording icon on the upper left corner of the "
"interface (shown below), select an address to save the recording, click OK, "
"the recording will begin. When recording is stopped, the recording will "
"appear in the previously saved address."
msgstr ""
"最后，点击界面左上角的红色录制图标（如下图所示），选择保存录制文件的地址，点击 OK，录制即开始。停止录制后，录制文件将出现在之前保存的地址中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:231
#: 0b661ad61c954dc385b83055c869844e
msgid ""
"To play the recorded data, click the green play icon, select a playback "
"speed, select the specified address of your stored data file, then the data "
"will be played."
msgstr "要播放已录制的数据，点击绿色播放图标，选择播放速度，选择存储数据文件的指定地址，然后数据将开始播放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:237
#: 7906a8dbaff84d67a8993a5cd36a08eb
msgid "Use U-Centre for debugging/advanced configuration"
msgstr "使用 U-Centre 进行调试/高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:238
#: 2e978aa1415c43e98d6d128495346a99
msgid ""
"-Check Status of Base Station. Connect the base module to U-center software,"
" check the display box in the upper right corner of the interface, Fix Mode "
"section is displayed as TIME. If Fix Mode does not enter TIME, the current "
"state of the base station is not sufficient to allow the rover module to "
"enter RTK mode. As shown in the figure below, Fix Mode is displayed in 3D "
"mode, hence the RTK standard has not yet been reached."
msgstr ""
"-检查基站状态。将基站模块连接到 U-center 软件，检查界面右上角的显示框，Fix Mode 部分显示为 TIME。如果 Fix Mode 未进入"
" TIME，则基站当前状态不足以让流动站模块进入 RTK 模式。如下图所示，Fix Mode 显示为 3D 模式，因此尚未达到 RTK 标准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:244
#: 98b5998828694b89b6d4c37d7fd4d536
msgid ""
"The possible reasons for Base station not entering TIME Mode: Firstly, the "
"signal received by base station is not strong enough. To check the satellite"
" strength received by base station, see the bottom right corner of the "
"software interface. The vertical bars in the box indicate satellites "
"strength received by the current base station. A vertical bar represents a "
"satellite (GPS or Beidou / GLONASS, depending on the choice of satellite "
"systems). TIME Mode of base station requires: 5 GPS satellite signals +2 "
"GLONASS satellite signals in the strength of 40 or more; or 5 GPS satellite "
"signals +3 Beidou satellite signal in the strength of 40 or more. As shown "
"in the figure below, only one satellite strength is higher than 40, the "
"signal condition does not meet the RTK standard."
msgstr ""
"基站未进入 TIME "
"模式的可能原因：首先，基站接收到的信号不够强。要检查基站接收到的卫星信号强度，查看软件界面右下角。框中的垂直条表示当前基站接收的卫星信号强度。一个垂直条代表一颗卫星（GPS"
" 或北斗/GLONASS，取决于卫星系统选择）。基站 TIME 模式要求：5 个 GPS 卫星信号 +2 个 GLONASS 卫星信号，信号强度 40 "
"或以上；或 5 个 GPS 卫星信号 +3 个北斗卫星信号，信号强度 40 或以上。如下图所示，只有一颗卫星信号强度高于 40，信号条件不符合 RTK "
"标准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:249
#: 105b52e99a9c445c9c538ad4ae246555
msgid ""
"Secondly, the user input of survey-in accuracy requirement is too strict to "
"achieve, or the base station has not yet completed the surveying process. "
"Using U-centre for survey-in setup, please refer to section c) in this "
"chapter."
msgstr "其次，用户输入的勘测精度要求过于严格难以达到，或基站尚未完成勘测过程。使用 U-centre 进行勘测设置，请参阅本章第 c) 节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:251
#: 4b119e11a84449f59f5f360ac9adc64b
msgid ""
"-Check whether Rover receives base correction data(Timeout). After the base "
"station enters the TIME Mode, it is necessary to transmit the RTCM data to "
"the rover, for rover to enter RTK modes. Therefore, a real-time and "
"efficient communication between rover and base station is necessary for good"
" RTK positioning performance."
msgstr ""
"-检查流动站是否接收到基站差分数据（超时）。基站进入 TIME 模式后，需要将 RTCM 数据传输到流动站，以使流动站进入 RTK "
"模式。因此，流动站与基站之间实时高效的通信对良好的 RTK 定位性能至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:254
#: bd48b1a8a58d49729629688a57b68173
msgid ""
"Check whether there is a delay in the data transmission between the mobile "
"station and the base station, connect the rover module to U-center (or "
"replay the data log to inspect a previous operation). Go to Messages view ->"
" NMEA -> GxGGA directory to see Age of DGNSS Corr parameters. This parameter"
" represents the time at which the rover did not receive the base station "
"data. In the case of the default base station message frequency 1HZ, if this"
" parameter exceeds 1s, there is a certain delay in the data transmission."
msgstr ""
"检查移动站与基站之间的数据传输是否有延迟，将流动站模块连接到 U-center（或回放数据日志以检查之前的操作）。进入 Messages view ->"
" NMEA -> GxGGA 目录，查看 Age of DGNSS Corr 参数。此参数表示流动站未接收到基站数据的时间。在默认基站消息频率 1Hz "
"的情况下，如果此参数超过 1s，则数据传输存在一定延迟。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:256
#: 6d2c2b8b60284c89bf349b7113f018b3
msgid ""
"-Set Survey-in/Fixed mode for base station. Similar to Mission Planner RTK "
"Inject page, U-center can also be used to set the base station survey-in "
"time and accuracy. Enter the Messages view option, UBX's CGF menu, enter the"
" TMODE3 tab. Select 1.Survey-in under the Mode drop-down option, and set the"
" survey time (and the minimum time required for the base station to survey)."
" The survey-in current status can be viewed in the NAV-> SVIN page in "
"Message View."
msgstr ""
"-为基站设置勘测/固定模式。与 Mission Planner RTK Inject 页面类似，U-center 也可以用于设置基站勘测时间和精度。进入"
" Messages view 选项，UBX 的 CGF 菜单，进入 TMODE3 标签页。在 Mode 下拉选项中选择 1.Survey-"
"in，设置勘测时间（和基站勘测所需的最短时间）。勘测当前状态可在 Message View 的 NAV-> SVIN 页面中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:262
#: e37dbdeea5884c72a4e0db37a3f52070
msgid ""
"The base station can also be set to Fixed Mode. When the base station's "
"current precise geographic coordinates are known, the coordinates can be "
"entered directly into the base station, which saves the time required for "
"surveying. In the TMODE3 page, select Fixed mode in the drop-down list, and "
"then enter the precise known base station coordinates."
msgstr ""
"基站也可以设置为固定模式。当已知基站当前精确地理坐标时，可以直接将坐标输入基站，这样可以省去勘测所需的时间。在 TMODE3 "
"页面中，在下拉列表中选择固定模式，然后输入已知的精确基站坐标。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:264
#: f656bb5a1a744059a575366ecab596a3
msgid ""
"After setting the survey or fixed mode, click the Send button at the bottom "
"left of the page to transfer the modified data to the base station."
msgstr "设置勘测或固定模式后，点击页面左下角的 Send 按钮，将修改后的数据传输到基站。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:266
#: 1be6bebd526f4f758f55b976990e3599
msgid ""
"-Use Beidou/GLonass. The uBlox 1.30 firmware uses the GPS + GLONASS "
"navigation system for location services by default. If you want to change to"
" GPS + Beidou navigation system, you need to enter the Messages view -> UBX "
"-> CGF -> GNSS directory, cancel the tick on GLONASS Enable option, and then"
" check the Beidou Enable option. After the selection, click send to complete"
" the change."
msgstr ""
"-使用北斗/GLONASS。uBlox 1.30 固件默认使用 GPS + GLONASS 导航系统提供定位服务。如需更改为 GPS + "
"北斗导航系统，需要进入 Messages view -> UBX -> CGF -> GNSS 目录，取消勾选 GLONASS Enable "
"选项，然后勾选 Beidou Enable 选项。选择完成后，点击 send 以完成更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:272
#: 8a6430c2cbc246f1a8b77946d7f877c6
msgid ""
"To save the current settings, go to the Messages view -> UBX -> CFG "
"(Configuration) page and click the Save current configuration option, then "
"click Send (as shown below)."
msgstr ""
"要保存当前设置，进入 Messages view -> UBX -> CFG (Configuration) 页面，点击 Save current "
"configuration 选项，然后点击 Send（如下图所示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:279
#: 2257b25438e24bd986922aab40ee22a6
msgid ""
"Base station and rover should use the same navigation system configuration, "
"or rover will not be able to enter RTK modes."
msgstr "基站和流动站应使用相同的导航系统配置，否则流动站将无法进入 RTK 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:281
#: afada4dd020d4e07a89afa5b310489b2
msgid ""
"-Base module I/O port and protocol setup. UBlox M8P chip supports a variety "
"of input and output protocols, including USB, UART, I2C and so on. The HERE "
"+ base station module uses the USB port for data communication and RTK "
"outputs. If you need to confirm the current settings, go to the Messages "
"view -> UBX -> CFG -> PRT directory and select 3-USB in the Target field. "
"The correct input and output protocols are shown below:"
msgstr ""
"-基站模块 I/O 端口和协议设置。UBlox M8P 芯片支持多种输入和输出协议，包括 USB、UART、I2C 等。HERE+ 基站模块使用 USB"
" 端口进行数据通信和 RTK 输出。如需确认当前设置，进入 Messages view -> UBX -> CFG -> PRT 目录，在 Target"
" 字段中选择 3-USB。正确的输入和输出协议如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:288
#: 98d58799bf7442af9af15769c4a2eba2
msgid ""
"If you want to use more output protocols (such as UART), you can also select"
" the output protocol and a specific message combination on this page. If you"
" want to set a string of specific messages to output under a variety of "
"protocols, you can go to the Messages view -> UBX -> CGF -> MSG directory, "
"select a specific message, and then check the type of protocol you want to "
"output."
msgstr ""
"如果需要使用更多输出协议（如 UART），也可以在此页面上选择输出协议和特定消息组合。如果需要设置特定消息串在多种协议下输出，可以进入 Messages"
" view -> UBX -> CGF -> MSG 目录，选择特定消息，然后勾选要输出的协议类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:290
#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:298
#: c8875d761268452db1b7cb52d4125621 cbeda379143248a095f8c0b064e9962a
msgid ""
"To save the current settings, go to the Messages view -> UBX -> CFG "
"(Configuration) page and click the Save current configuration option, then "
"click Send."
msgstr ""
"要保存当前设置，进入 Messages view -> UBX -> CFG (Configuration) 页面，点击 Save current "
"configuration 选项，然后点击 Send。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:292
#: c74c7ac222aa4c3dba81a5c05d2165e8
msgid ""
"-Change Rover module output rate. By default, the output frequency of the "
"position information by the rover module is 1HZ. If you need to speed up the"
" position output frequency, you can enter the Messages view -> UBX -> CGF ->"
" RATE directory, change the Measurement Period. For example, the measurement"
" period is changed to 200 ms and the measurement frequency will be increased"
" to 5 Hz."
msgstr ""
"-更改流动站模块输出频率。默认情况下，流动站模块的位置信息输出频率为 1Hz。如果需要提高位置输出频率，可以进入 Messages view -> "
"UBX -> CGF -> RATE 目录，更改 Measurement Period。例如，将测量周期改为 200 ms，测量频率将提升至 5 Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:301
#: e1409625c42747dbb6a17927872b90b3
msgid "Change Base Antenna and Testing"
msgstr "更换基站天线与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-here-plus-gps.rst:302
#: e7a137f37788441c916dd98dc21d37ed
msgid ""
"HERE + base module antenna is a Taoglass antenna. Users can select different"
" antennas according to their needs and connect them to base module. We have "
"conducted a test of three different antennas in an outdoor environment, "
"where three antennas at the same time, same location were connected to the "
"HERE + base station, data were logged using Ucentre recording function. It "
